Ingobia Seller Operations — Comprehensive Engineering, Reliability, Security & UX Completion

Mission

Perform a comprehensive engineering audit, correction, and improvement of the existing Ingobia Seller Operations application.

This is a completion and stabilization task, NOT a rebuild.

The current priority is to finish the existing operational system so it can reliably manage products, inventory, orders, returns, financial records, and platform-specific operations.

The application must become accurate, stable, secure, intuitive, and comfortable to use before moving to Phase 2 of the roadmap.

Do not focus on adding more features. Focus on correcting the existing system, eliminating technical and logical defects, improving the user experience, and ensuring that all operational workflows behave realistically.

